  "summary": "Single-target special damage to the cast target equal to a per-synergy-level amount (10 for 1-3 stars, 20 beyond) multiplied by the sum of the owner player's synergy values for each of the caster's types. The caster's types are dynamic for these units (the PROTEAN3 passive adds the player's three highest synergies while the unit is on the board), so the multiplier depends on the board, not on a table. A caster without a player, or whose types have no synergy value, requests a raw 0, which is NOT a resolved 0: an unblocked target still takes 1 (see the damage resolution).",
